<title>USA: AlliedSignal to supply wheels, brakes.</title>
<headline>AlliedSignal to supply wheels, brakes.</headline>
<text>
<p>TORRANCE, Calif, Feb 12 - AlliedSignal Inc said it was selected to supply wheels and brakes for Garuda Indonesia's recent order of 17 Boeing 737-300/500 aircraft.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
